{"id":"memorial_101903","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial101900","label":"Call Logs · Audio Portion of a Streamer's Live Stream"},"label":"BJ_03.mp4","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_101902","next":null,"speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_101903_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_03_description","text":"(The file is corrupted, and only the audio can be played.)"},{"id":"memorial_101903_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_03_description","text":"See? I made a weapon yesterday."},{"id":"memorial_101903_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_03_description","text":"I took some iron fencing and stuck it to some plywood. That way, it's a weapon and a shield all at once."},{"id":"memorial_101903_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_03_description","text":"What do you think? Not bad, huh? And... can't forget the bulletproof vest..."},{"id":"memorial_101903_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_03_description","text":"Ta-da! All done! How do you like it?"},{"id":"memorial_101903_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_03_description","text":"Anyway, I can't go out there with just my fists. You've at least got to let me arm myself."},{"id":"memorial_101903_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_03_description","text":"Thanks, TheRestless, for your donation!"},{"id":"memorial_101903_8","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_03_description","text":"All right, guys, check this out. I'm gonna bust up not one, not two, but THREE aliens."},{"id":"memorial_101903_9","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_03_description","text":"*Deep breath*"},{"id":"memorial_101903_10","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_03_description","text":"Am I scared? Of course not! I'm just psyching myself up. Here we go!"},{"id":"memorial_101903_11","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_03_description","text":"*Bang*"},{"id":"memorial_101903_12","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_03_description","text":"Hey, you bucket of bolts, over here!"},{"id":"memorial_101903_13","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_03_description","text":"Did you see that? Here they come."},{"id":"memorial_101903_14","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_03_description","text":"It's showtime!!"},{"id":"memorial_101903_15","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_03_description","text":"Ha! Haha! You see that? Like shooting fish in a barrel."},{"id":"memorial_101903_16","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_03_description","text":"Batter up...!"},{"id":"memorial_101903_17","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_03_description","text":"*Crack*"},{"id":"memorial_101903_18","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_03_description","text":"Ah... AAAAHHHH!!!!! My arms!!!"},{"id":"memorial_101903_19","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_03_description","text":"Someone... *Gasp* help..."},{"id":"memorial_101903_20","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_03_description","text":"*Crack* *Snap*"},{"id":"memorial_101903_21","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_03_description","text":"AARGGGHHHH! Help!!!!"},{"id":"memorial_101903_22","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_19_03_description","text":"He-lp me..."}]}